    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, ive been feeling really weird lately. i had the flu a few weeks ago and i thought i was over it, but i still feel super wiped out. like, even just walking up a flight of stairs makes me super out of breath and my heart feels like it's racing or fluttering in my chest. sometimes it feels heavy too. is this just like, normal post-flu fatigue or should i be worried??",
