      "content": "i mean i know i should probably see a doctor but i really dont have the time or money for an er visit right now. it's probably just because i'm stressed or not eating enough since i was sick, right? like, can't i just take some vitamins or maybe some magnesium to help with the fluttering? i feel like if i just rest and take some supplements i'll be fine in a few days.",
