      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i just feel like im overreacting. i read online that most people who get the flu get these random palpitations and it just takes a few weeks for the body to reset. my friend said i should just take a high dose of B12 and some extra electrolytes every morning and i'll be back to normal. do you think that would help me get through the week until things calm down? i really just want a way to manage this at home so i dont have to deal with doctors right now.",
